Bolum Input Deck
User must define diameter, velocity, theta_deg, init_strength, and density for the code to run
diameter            = 1.2        # meters
velocity            = 21200.0    # entry velocity in m/s (ranges from 11200 to ~70000)
theta_deg           = 25.        # degrees from the horizontal
init_strength       = 2.e5       # Pa
density             = 2800.0     # kg/m^3

Benesov (1991)



